/* Issues and their fixes */
"Issues" = "问题";
"Two copies of the same instructions" = "同一份指令存在两个副本";
"%1$@ is a full copy of %2$@. Rulebook saves both, but any other editor will let them drift. Replace %1$@ with an `@%2$@` import to keep one source." = "%1$@ 是 %2$@ 的完整副本。Rulebook 会同时存储两者，但用其他编辑器修改时它们会逐渐不一致。把 %1$@ 换成 `@%2$@` 导入，只保留一份内容。";
"Claude Code and other agents get different rules" = "Claude Code 和其他智能体读到的规则不同";
